{"id":34340,"slug":"isle-of-dogs","title":"Isle of Dogs","year":2018,"country":"United States","duration":101,"spine":1281,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/34340-isle-of-dogs","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/84a66f0dca5a33f7061fadb9a3248128/dXv4UUmmxKVMCj4PGIxFQGKcbfe93m_large.jpg","description":"Wes Anderson conjures a dystopian future Japan in magical stop-motion. After a canine virus outbreak, the dogs of Megasaki are exiled to a vast island garbage dump. When Atari (the daring twelve-year-old ward of the city’s mayor) sets out to rescue his beloved Spots, he meets a pack of mongrel friends and is launched on an epic quest. Innovatively blending English and Japanese dialogue through a cross-cultural voice cast that includes Bryan Cranston, Greta Gerwig, Jeff Goldblum, Scarlett Johansson, Yoko Ono, and Koyu Rankin, this fable of loyalty and disobedience combines Anderson’s signature themes—friendship among outsiders, the adventure of rebellion—with a delight in the boundless possibilities of animated storytelling.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Wes Anderson","slug":"wes-anderson"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Bryan Cranston","role":"Chief","slug":"bryan-cranston"},{"actor":"Koyu Rankin","role":"Atari","slug":"koyu-rankin"},{"actor":"Edward Norton","role":"Rex","slug":"edward-norton"},{"actor":"Bob Balaban","role":"King","slug":"bob-balaban"},{"actor":"Jeff Goldblum","role":"Duke","slug":"jeff-goldblum"},{"actor":"Bill Murray","role":"Boss","slug":"bill-murray"},{"actor":"Kunichi Nomura","role":"Mayor Kobayashi","slug":"kunichi-nomura"},{"actor":"Akira Ito","role":"Professor Watanabe","slug":"akira-ito"},{"actor":"Greta Gerwig","role":"Tracy Walker","slug":"greta-gerwig"},{"actor":"Frances McDormand","role":"Interpreter Nelson","slug":"frances-mcdormand"},{"actor":"Akira Takayama","role":"Major-Domo","slug":"akira-takayama"},{"actor":"Scarlett Johansson","role":"Nutmeg","slug":"scarlett-johansson"},{"actor":"Harvey Keitel","r